  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support of two NPA Multi-Task Demining Teams in Tajikistan</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">THE PURPOSE OF NPA&apos;S MINE ACTION AND DISARMAMENT PROGRAM IN TAJIKISTAN IS TO ENSURE LANDMINES, CLUSTER MUNITIONS, AND OTHER EXPLOSIVE REMNANTS NO LONGER EXPOSE CIVILIANS TO UNACCEPTABLE RISK OR PREVENT ECONOMIC, SOCIAL, AND POLITICAL DEVELOPMENT IN TAJIK</narrative>
  </description>
